# ls command - List current directory files

## Flags

### ls

list dir contents

input:

```sh
ls
```

output:

```sh
DEMO_DIR  demo_file
```

### ls -a

including hidden starting with `.`

```sh
ls -a # or -all
```

### ls -A

hidden files except . (current dir) and .. (previous dir)

```sh
ls -A # or --almost-all
```
